              "url": "https://www.damtp.cam.ac.uk/user/tong/qft/qfthtml/S2.html",
              "locator": "Complete HTML Chapter 2; free scalar modes, vacuum and point-field smearing in §2.2, vacuum in §2.3, and spacelike commutativity in §2.6.1."
            },
