              "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/hep-th/0409036",
              "locator": "Complete full-text Part II; §§37 and 39, Dirac plane-wave modes, canonical anticommutators and particle/antiparticle operators."
            },
            {
              "title": "Christopher J. Fewster and Kasia Rejzner, Algebraic Quantum Field Theory—an introduction, complete author manuscript, arXiv:1904.04051v2",
              "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/1904.04051v2",
              "locator": "Complete full-text lecture article; §§2.2 and 4.2 on test-function-labelled fields, the free scalar Weyl algebra, local algebras and even Dirac observables."
            }
          ]
